<title>USA: Housecall Medical names Fred Follmer CFO.</title>
<headline>Housecall Medical names Fred Follmer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Housecall Medical Resources Inc said it appointed Fred Follmer, 54, as vice president, chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Follmer will replace Peter Bibb, who will continue with the company as vice president, chief administrative officer reporting to Follmer.</p>
<p>Follmer served as chief financial officer of Preferred oncology networks of America Inc., a private company specializing in disease management and physician practice management for oncologists.</p>
</text>
